&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 216pt 0pt 21.6pt; text-indent: -21.6pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(1) Includes costs associated with the affiliate agreement described above.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 216pt 0pt 21.6pt; text-indent: -21.6pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(2) 2025 and 2024 amounts include costs&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;associated with a pipeline capacity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="text-indent: -28.8px;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;agreement, which terminated in May 2025, with Enable Oklahoma Intrastate Transmission, LLC&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of $2.5 million and $5.5 million, respectively&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Subsequent Event&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Subsequent to December 31, 2025 and through the issuance of this report, we made cash distributions to our Members totaling $37.0 million, inclusive of amounts representing income taxes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;6. Rate and Regulatory Matters&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
