        <xhtml:p class="Normal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Volumes shown on this line are those for vent gas, heater fuel and greenhouse gas. This footnote applies to all periods within the quarter.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
